{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02819","headline":"初夏日幽庄 · 卢照邻","name":"初夏日幽庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻有高踪客，耿介坐幽庄。\n林壑人事少，风烟鸟路长。\n瀑水含秋气，垂藤引夏凉。\n苗深全覆陇，荷上半侵塘。\n钓渚青凫没，村田白鹭翔。\n知君振奇藻，还嗣海隅芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}